---
import DispatchIllustration from "./DispatchIllustration.astro";
import HeroIntro from "./HeroIntro.astro";
import OpsWizard from "./OpsWizard.astro";
---

<div class="hierarchy-hero">
  <HeroIntro />

  <figure class="hierarchy" aria-labelledby="hierarchy-title" aria-describedby="hierarchy-description">
    <figcaption class="visually-hidden">
      <span id="hierarchy-title">Central Agentic Ops execution hierarchy</span>
      <span id="hierarchy-description">A private control plane runs Supply chain, Compliance, Security, and Governance operation campaigns, routes every campaign through every authorized organization to every repo, and correlates every outcome into an operational report excerpt.</span>
    </figcaption>

    <DispatchIllustration />
  </figure>

</div>

<section class="operations-overview" aria-labelledby="operations-overview-title">
  <div class="overview-copy">
    <p class="overview-eyebrow">Agentic operations as code</p>
    <h2 id="operations-overview-title">Campaign once. Operate everywhere.</h2>
    <p>
      Choose a ready operation or build your own. Customize it once, run it safely across any set of repositories, and
      prove the value it delivers.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ol class="operations-path" aria-label="How Central Agentic Ops works">
    <li><span>1</span>Choose or build</li>
    <li><span>2</span>Campaign your expertise</li>
    <li><span>3</span>Run on one repository or thousands</li>
    <li><span>4</span>Review and measure the outcome</li>
  </ol>

  <p class="overview-boundary">
    Each organization, team, region, or trust boundary can run its own operations hub. Central means managed in one
    place within that boundary, not one global installation. The CAO Evolution operation can spot missing capabilities
    and suggest what to adopt or author next; maintainers still approve every installation and rollout.
  </p>
  <a class="overview-link" href="/gh-aw-cao/architecture-at-a-glance/">See how Central Agentic Ops works <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</section>

<OpsWizard />

<style>
  @layer starlight.core {
    .hierarchy-hero {
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate;
      display: grid;
      overflow: clip;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding-block: 2rem 3rem;
    }

    .hierarchy {
      animation: hero-enter 700ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1) both;
    }

    .visually-hidden {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
      clip-path: inset(50%);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .hierarchy {
      --scene-width: min(58rem, calc(100vw - 3rem));
      width: var(--scene-width);
      margin-inline: auto;
    }


    .operations-overview {
      width: min(100%, 64rem);
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
      padding: 2.5rem clamp(1rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      border-block: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    }

    .overview-copy {
      max-width: 48rem;
    }

    .overview-eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
      color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
      font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .operations-overview h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--sl-color-white);
      font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    .overview-copy > p:last-child,
    .overview-boundary {
      color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .operations-path {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .operations-path li {
      border-block-start: 2px solid var(--sl-color-text-accent);
      padding-block-start: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--sl-color-white);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .operations-path span {
      display: block;
      margin-block-end: 0.25rem;
      color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
      font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    }

    .overview-boundary {
      max-width: 56rem;
      margin-block: 0 1rem;
    }

    .overview-link {
      color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .overview-link:hover,
    .overview-link:focus-visible {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    @keyframes hero-enter {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0.75rem); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 42rem) {
      .hierarchy-hero {
        width: calc(100% + 2rem);
        margin-inline: -1rem;
        gap: 2rem;
        padding-inline: 1rem !important;
      }

      .hierarchy {
        width: 100vw;
        margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw);
      }

      .operations-overview {
        margin-block-end: 2rem;
        padding-block: 2rem;
      }

      .operations-path {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .hierarchy {
        animation: none;
      }
    }

    @media (min-width: 64rem) {
      .hierarchy-hero {
        min-height: auto;
        padding-block: 3rem 4rem;
      }

    }
  }
</style>